  Skael adopts skill-creator's evals/evals.json schema unchanged, and its
  grading.json expectation shape. The grader instruction in
  internal/eval/score/grade.go is adapted from that skill's agents/grader.md.
  No source file is vendored.

  internal/eval/tune ports the description optimization loop from that skill's
  scripts/run_loop.py and scripts/improve_description.py. The port keeps the
  train and test split. It also keeps the improvement prompt. Skael adapts
  the prompt that drafts trigger queries from the same skill's SKILL.md.
  web/src/features/quality/trigger-review.tsx is a port of that skill's
  assets/eval_review.html. No source file is vendored.
